{"page": 1, "segments": [{"index": 0, "text": "invariant: Property that holds before each iteration; used to prove\ncorrectness (Initialization, Maintenance, Termination). - RAM model:\nGeneric one-processor computational model; instructions execute one after\nanother, each taking constant time.", "rects": [[62.25, 56.24958038330078, 471.4571838378906, 70.34957885742188], [62.25, 70.47923278808594, 489.34088134765625, 84.44723510742188], [62.25, 84.44798278808594, 522.3780517578125, 98.41598510742188], [62.25, 98.54563903808594, 278.0340881347656, 112.51364135742188]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/1/audio/seg_0000.wav", "duration": 18.15}, {"index": 1, "text": "- Input size: For sorting, number n of\nitems; for integer multiplication, number of bits. - Running time: Number\nof instructions and data accesses executed. - Order of growth: Rate at\nwhich running time increases as n grows; focus on leading term, ignoring\nconstants and lower-order terms.", "rects": [[281.85009765625, 98.54563903808594, 514.1488647460938, 112.51364135742188], [62.25, 112.64329528808594, 519.5914916992188, 126.61129760742188], [62.25, 126.74095153808594, 498.6570129394531, 140.70895385742188], [62.25, 140.70970153808594, 512.2261352539062, 154.67770385742188], [62.25, 154.80735778808594, 265.4940185546875, 168.77536010742188]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/1/audio/seg_0001.wav", "duration": 20.925}, {"index": 2, "text": "- \u0398-notation (informal): \u201cRoughly\nproportional when n is large.\u201d - Incremental method: Build solution by\nadding one element at a time (insertion sort). - Divide-and-conquer: Break\ninto subproblems, solve recursively, combine solutions.", "rects": [[269.3100280761719, 154.80735778808594, 486.832275390625, 168.77536010742188], [62.25, 168.90501403808594, 505.2287902832031, 182.87301635742188], [62.25, 183.00267028808594, 527.5182495117188, 196.97067260742188], [62.25, 197.10032653808594, 398.1900329589844, 211.06832885742188]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/1/audio/seg_0002.wav", "duration": 17.325}, {"index": 3, "text": "- Merge sort:\nDivide-and-conquer sort: divide in half, recursively sort each, merge sorted\nhalves. - Inversion: Pair (i,j) with i < j and A[i] > A[j]. - Theorem 2.1: Any\ncomparison sort can be augmented to count inversions in O(n lg n) time.", "rects": [[402.00604248046875, 197.10032653808594, 487.96392822265625, 211.06832885742188], [62.25, 211.06907653808594, 520.794189453125, 225.03707885742188], [62.25, 225.16673278808594, 519.0477294921875, 239.13473510742188], [62.25, 239.13548278808594, 504.84613037109375, 253.10348510742188]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/1/audio/seg_0003.wav", "duration": 18.725}, {"index": 4, "text": "- \nBubble sort sorts by swapping adjacent inversions; \u0398(n\u00b2) compares/swaps\nworst-case. - Number of inversions: Any sequence has between 0 and C(n,\n2) inversions. Average: n(n-1)/4.", "rects": [[508.6621398925781, 239.13548278808594, 516.5341186523438, 253.10348510742188], [62.25, 253.10113525390625, 521.1146850585938, 267.2011413574219], [62.25, 267.330810546875, 528.1219482421875, 281.2987976074219], [62.25, 281.299560546875, 257.89794921875, 295.2675476074219]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/1/audio/seg_0004.wav", "duration": 15.025}, {"index": 5, "text": "HORNER\u2019S RULE (Problem 2-3): Evaluate polynomial P(x) = \u03a3 a_i x^i in\n\u0398(n).", "rects": [[62.25, 307.26519775390625, 512.62890625, 321.3652038574219], [62.25, 321.365966796875, 92.99400329589844, 335.3339538574219]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/1/audio/seg_0005.wav", "duration": 8.425}, {"index": 6, "text": "y = 0\nfor i = n down to 0\n    y = a_i + x\u00b7y", "rects": [[62.25, 347.334716796875, 98.37001037597656, 361.3027038574219], [62.25, 361.303466796875, 199.50604248046875, 375.2714538574219], [62.25, 375.272216796875, 185.05804443359375, 389.2402038574219]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/1/audio/seg_0006.wav", "duration": 6.9}, {"index": 7, "text": "Loop invariant: y = \u03a3_{k=i}^{n} a_k x^{k-i} after iteration i.\nNaive evaluation: \u0398(n\u00b2). Horner: \u0398(n). Key difference: no repeated\nexponentiation.", "rects": [[92.25, 401.240966796875, 472.97406005859375, 415.2089538574219], [92.25, 415.20660400390625, 507.1534423828125, 429.3066101074219], [92.25, 429.307373046875, 186.83399963378906, 443.2753601074219]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/1/audio/seg_0007.wav", "duration": 13.975}, {"index": 8, "text": "INSERTION-SORT(A, n) - Input: Array A[1:n], integer n. Output: A[1:n]\nsorted. - Steps: 1. for i = 2 to n 2. key = A[i] 3. j = i - 1 4. while j \n> 0 and A[j] > key 5. A[j+1] = A[j] 6. j = j - 1 7.", "rects": [[62.25, 455.27301025390625, 509.20440673828125, 469.3730163574219], [62.25, 469.373779296875, 527.0167236328125, 483.3417663574219], [62.25, 483.342529296875, 404.6546630859375, 497.3105163574219]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/1/audio/seg_0008.wav", "duration": 20.525}, {"index": 9, "text": "A[j+1] = key - \nLoop invariant: At start of each iteration, A[1:i-1] is sorted and contains\noriginal elements. - Complexity: Best \u0398(n), worst \u0398(n\u00b2), average \u0398(n\u00b2).", "rects": [[408.46875, 483.342529296875, 506.8520812988281, 497.3105163574219], [62.25, 497.30816650390625, 508.73492431640625, 511.4081726074219], [62.25, 511.537841796875, 497.5166015625, 525.5057983398438]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/1/audio/seg_0009.wav", "duration": 14.75}, {"index": 10, "text": "MERGE(A, p, q, r) - Merge two sorted subarrays A[p:q] and A[q+1:r] into\nsorted A[p:r]. - Steps: Copy to L and R arrays, then merge by comparing\nsmallest remaining. - Complexity: \u0398(n) where n = r-p+1. - Invariant:\nA[p:k-1] contains k-p smallest elements of L and R in sorted order.", "rects": [[62.25, 537.5034790039062, 519.291015625, 551.6034545898438], [62.25, 551.604248046875, 502.9501953125, 565.5722045898438], [62.25, 565.701904296875, 485.29205322265625, 579.6698608398438], [62.25, 579.670654296875, 466.0981140136719, 593.6386108398438]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/1/audio/seg_0010.wav", "duration": 24.4}, {"index": 11, "text": "MERGE-SORT(A, p, r)", "rects": [[62.25, 605.6362915039062, 209.1300048828125, 619.7362670898438]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/1/audio/seg_0011.wav", "duration": 2.275}, {"index": 12, "text": "if p \u2265 r\n    return\nq = \u230a(p+r)/2\u230b\nMERGE-SORT(A, p, q)\nMERGE-SORT(A, q+1, r)\nMERGE(A, p, q, r)", "rects": [[62.25, 631.737060546875, 120.04202270507812, 645.7050170898438], [62.25, 645.705810546875, 134.49002075195312, 659.6737670898438], [62.25, 659.674560546875, 156.1620330810547, 673.6425170898438], [62.25, 673.643310546875, 199.50604248046875, 687.6112670898438], [62.25, 687.612060546875, 213.95404052734375, 701.5800170898438], [62.25, 701.580810546875, 185.05804443359375, 715.5487670898438]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/1/audio/seg_0012.wav", "duration": 13.95}, {"index": 13, "text": "Recurrence: T(n) = 2T(n/2) + \u0398(n) \u2192 \u0398(n lg n).\nProof by recursion tree: n + n + \u2026 + n (lg n times) = n lg n.\nSpace: \u0398(n) auxiliary for merge.", "rects": [[92.25, 727.549560546875, 377.9339904785156, 741.5175170898438], [92.25, 741.5151977539062, 473.7265319824219, 755.6151733398438], [92.25, 755.6128540039062, 291.31146240234375, 769.7128295898438]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/1/audio/seg_0013.wav", "duration": 15.925}, {"index": 14, "text": "\u2022 \n\u2022", "rects": [[81.357421875, 401.240966796875, 92.25342559814453, 415.2089538574219], [81.357421875, 415.209716796875, 88.43742370605469, 429.1777038574219], [81.357421875, 727.549560546875, 92.25342559814453, 741.5175170898438], [81.357421875, 741.518310546875, 88.43742370605469, 755.4862670898438]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/1/audio/seg_0014.wav", "duration": 0}, {"index": 15, "text": "\u2022 \n\u2022 \n\u2022", "rects": [[81.357421875, 401.240966796875, 92.25342559814453, 415.2089538574219], [81.357421875, 415.209716796875, 92.25342559814453, 429.1777038574219], [81.357421875, 727.549560546875, 88.43742370605469, 741.5175170898438]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/1/audio/seg_0015.wav", "duration": 0}], "total_segments": 16, "status": "ready"}